sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Storefront as Customer Storefront
    participant Backend as Protected Edge Function
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Admin as Admin Workspace
    participant PayMongo

    Customer->>Storefront: Request cancellation or return
    Storefront->>Backend: Submit authenticated request and reason
    Backend->>DB: Validate ownership, order status, and payment state
    alt Unpaid or cancellable order
        Backend->>DB: Cancel order and restore eligible stock
        DB-->>Admin: Publish cancellation event
        DB-->>Storefront: Publish final order status
    else Paid order requires review
        Backend->>DB: Create protected refund requirement
        DB-->>Admin: Notify administrator for review
        Admin->>Backend: Approve eligible refund workflow
        Backend->>PayMongo: Submit provider refund request
        PayMongo-->>Backend: Return refund reference and state
        Backend->>DB: Store payment and refund result
        DB-->>Storefront: Publish refund status
    end
    Storefront-->>Customer: Show cancellation or refund outcome
